  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Shelter and Non-food Items (ESNFI) Assistance to Populations Affected by Crises in Jara, North Wello, Amhara Regions of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides lifesaving humanitarian assistance focusing on shelter support targeting internally displaced persons (IDPs) in Jara IDP Site, North Wello, Amhara region in Ethiopia. Key activities will include construction of communal shelters and distribution of emergency shelters and non-food item kits.</narrative>
  </description>
